---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Memberships" description="Long-term healthcare built on relationships.">

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Memberships</span>
      <h1>Relationship for the long term.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Every membership begins with a comprehensive onboarding consultation. From that point forward, your care is guided by a doctor who truly knows you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split fade-up">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67812a141d8f2465fe6175eb/69c11723fbd8abfea21d153a_031354cd315326fa864ff8e5f33fe118_foundation-clinic-approach2.webp" alt="Membership onboarding" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2>Your care, from day one.</h2>
          <p>Every membership begins with a comprehensive onboarding consultation. During this first visit, your doctor reviews your medical history, conducts a detailed examination, and orders extensive laboratory tests when appropriate.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 16px;">Following the onboarding consultation, your doctor prepares a personalised health report and long-term health plan.</p>
          <div style="margin-top: 28px; padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--bg-sunken); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border-left: 3px solid var(--teal);">
            <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-1); margin-bottom: 4px;">Onboarding consultation</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.4rem; font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--fg-1);">€599</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); color: var(--fg-3); margin-top: 4px;">One-time fee, includes full health examination and personalised health report.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sunken" id="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="margin-bottom: 56px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
        <h2>Choose the level of care that fits your needs.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 16px;">Each membership tier reflects a different level of support and availability.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="pricing-card fade-up">
          <div class="pricing-tier">Tier 1</div>
          <div class="price">€99</div>
          <div class="price-label">per month</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Named doctor</li>
            <li>9am–5pm Mon–Fri</li>
            <li>Prescription renewals</li>
            <li>Health review at onboarding</li>
            <li>1 remote consultation / month</li>
            <li>Influenza vaccination</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">Get started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card featured fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.08s">
          <div class="pricing-tier">Tier 2</div>
          <div class="price">€199</div>
          <div class="price-label">per month</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Named doctor</li>
            <li>9am–5pm Mon–Fri</li>
            <li>Prescription renewals</li>
            <li>Annual health review</li>
            <li>3 remote consultations / month</li>
            <li>1 in-person consultation / month</li>
            <li>Influenza vaccination</li>
            <li>Referrals & care coordination</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center; background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Get started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.16s">
          <div class="pricing-tier">Tier 3</div>
          <div class="price">€399</div>
          <div class="price-label">per month</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Named doctor</li>
            <li>9am–5pm Mon–Fri</li>
            <li>Prescription renewals</li>
            <li>Biannual health reviews</li>
            <li>5 remote consultations / month</li>
            <li>3 in-person consultations / month</li>
            <li>Influenza vaccination</li>
            <li>Referrals & care coordination</li>
            <li>External invoice management</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">Get started</a>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card fade-up" style="animation-delay: 0.24s">
          <div class="pricing-tier">Children</div>
          <div class="price">€49</div>
          <div class="price-label">per month</div>
          <ul class="pricing-features">
            <li>Named doctor</li>
            <li>9am–5pm Mon–Fri</li>
            <li>Prescription renewals</li>
            <li>2 remote consultations / month</li>
            <li>Influenza vaccination</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">Get started</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 40px; padding: 28px 32px; background: var(--bg-surface); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--t-15);">
        <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); color: var(--fg-3); margin-bottom: 10px;">* In Tier 1, remote consultations after the monthly complimentary consultation are billed separately. All in-person acute consultations are billed separately.</p>
        <p style="font-size: var(--body-sm); color: var(--fg-3);">Doctors' or nurses' at-home visits, extended or 24/7 doctor availability and international care coordination are also available upon request.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-ivory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Tailored care</span>
        <h2>Need something different?</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">We are happy to customise a membership for you. Please reach out to discuss your specific situation and needs.</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@foundation.clinic" class="btn btn-primary">hello@foundation.clinic</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-espresso">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center fade-up" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2>Contact us to explore how we can support your long-term health.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px;">We answer all emails within 24 hours.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn" style="background: var(--cream); color: var(--espresso);">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>